{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Sally in Spain", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "A Blogger in Spain", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 9, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 5, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A2.1", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Accurately use information about travel and vacations in social situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"content": "The Simple Past Tense", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the  Simple Past tense to talk about actions that happened in the past.<br/><br/>To form the Simple Past tense of a regular verb (in the Simple Present tense), follow these rules:<br/><br/>Add <span class = \"strong\">-ed</span> to the base form of the verb:<br/>walk \u2192 walked<br/>enjoy \u2192 enjoyed<br/><br/>For verbs that end in e, add <span class = \"strong\">-d</span> to the base form:<br/>like \u2192 liked<br/>invite \u2192 invited<br/><br/>For verbs that end in a consonant and y, change the y to i. Then add <span class = \"strong\">-ed</span>:<br/>try \u2192 tried<br/>study \u2192 studied<br/><br/>Some verbs do not follow the above rules. They are called irregular verbs. Here are the past tense forms of some irregular verbs:", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":9,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Base Form\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Simple Past Form\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"be\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"was/were\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"buy\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"bought\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"come\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"came\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"do\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"did\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"eat\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"ate\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"go\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"went\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"see\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"saw\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"sit\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"sat\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "roof", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the top of a building", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The roof looks like a flower.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le05ob09aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when describing a building.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "skylight", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a window in the ceiling", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: So much light comes into the room through the skylight.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le05ob09aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "daylight", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the natural light from the sun during the day", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Daylight comes in through the glass walls and the skylight.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le05ob09aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "dome", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a large, round roof on a building", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The building has a metal roof that looks like a dome.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le05ob09aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "masterpiece", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an influential piece of art; something made with great skill", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: This building is a masterpiece of architecture.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le05ob09aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "magnificent", "type": "name"}, {"content": "very impressive", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The daylight coming in through the glass walls is magnificent!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le05ob09aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"content": "engenn4le05ob09re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Expressing Opinions Using Present Simple", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use these expressions to express an opinion:  <br/>I think \u2026<br/> In my opinion \u2026 <br/>In my experience \u2026 <br/>As I see it \u2026 <br/>As far as I'm concerned \u2026", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "I think the top of the roof looks like a flower.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "This building is a masterpiece of architecture, in my opinion.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "As I see it, it's magnificent! ", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Think about your favorite artist. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "If you don't have a favorite artist, research one.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a summary of your artist's life and accomplishments. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use the Past tense.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write 10-15 sentences.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Share the information with your partner.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I identify details about one artist.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write a report about events in the past.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I tell my partner about the artist.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "engenn4le05ob09re2aud01", "images": [{"image": "engenn4le05ob09re2img02.jpg", "id": 0, "time": "", "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn4le05ob09re2img02.jpg", "id": 1, "time": "1", "text": "Hello again, and welcome to my travel blog! My trip is almost over. Now I'm back in Bilboa to catch my flight tomorrow. <br/>"}, {"image": "engenn4le05ob09re2img02.jpg", "id": 2, "time": "9300", "text": "Yesterday I went to the Guggenheim Museum. I think it shows interesting collections of modern art. I looked at paintings by European and American artists of the 20th century."}, {"image": "engenn4le05ob09re2img02.jpg", "id": 3, "time": "22000", "text": "They were in a building that's a masterpiece of architecture, in my opinion. The building is stone, metal and glass. Glass walls connect huge stone blocks. They have a metal roof that looks like a dome."}, {"image": "engenn4le05ob09re2img01.jpg", "id": 4, "time": "37000", "text": "From the outside, I think the top of the roof looks like a flower. Daylight comes in through the glass walls and the skylight.  As I see it, it's magnificent!"}], "coverimg": "engenn4le05ob09re2img02.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "id": 2}], "exercises": [{"id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0], "template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "I can talk about things to do on a trip.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can express opinions about other people and things.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can talk about what I did.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Do you like art?  Why or why not?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "Do you have a favorite work of art? What is it?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct", "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "Let's talk about art and architecture.", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "questions": []}, {"id": 1, "stimuli_ids": [2], "template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Let's read and listen to Sally's <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">blog</span> entry about the Guggenheim Museum.", "type": "text"}], "type": 